      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"poetic\" is a weird way to put it... but i guess i see what u mean. it feels more like a logical conclusion than something poetic. like if a program is just looping and getting nothing out of it, the most efficient thing to do is just terminate the process. it's not even sad, it's just... what happens when the function doesn't return anything meaningful. it's just better to be gone than to keep running an empty loop.",
